{"3429270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Revenge of the Firstborn", "steam_appid": 3429270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/5f31c981b99410eb81e01edbf0cb06b3.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d140c9a326b2f3f1d5468fbc1b4b5c9e.poster.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d140c9a326b2f3f1d5468fbc1b4b5c9e.webm?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Firstborn were immortal beings created to help shepherd and guide the universe. After violating the gods' prohibition on creating new life, they were sealed away and became a mere myth. Lead your party to uncover the truth of what really happened and decide if the Firstborn poses too great of a threat on the world, or if they are your path to immense power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/c64b034cbea2e1f263e8f7e9563066fd.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d7f62bbdace6a87eee6d55665fa14fa0.poster.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d7f62bbdace6a87eee6d55665fa14fa0.webm?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d7f62bbdace6a87eee6d55665fa14fa0.mp4?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Engage in exciting turn-based combat using one of the most accurate implementations of the classic 3.5 SRD. Equip and ride a war-horse, mastering mounted combat, a rarely-seen feature in overhead RPGs. Employ over 300 spells to vanquish your enemies of over 120 classic monsters who respond with intelligent, reactive AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/dbe885537bd6d1b55363f6ec72e15e66.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/4e9be0eeda229592aff65e7a8bb0e162.poster.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/4e9be0eeda229592aff65e7a8bb0e162.webm?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/4e9be0eeda229592aff65e7a8bb0e162.mp4?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Wander the countryside in search of long-forgotten treasures, but beware, many of them are well-guarded. Be careful not to stray off the beaten path too soon, as you might discover encounters more difficult than what you bargained for...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/156cbf2fb62c68b0d6b16329cb50992c.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/f095fe7411194b0381b48a898fd66ce2.poster.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/f095fe7411194b0381b48a898fd66ce2.webm?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/f095fe7411194b0381b48a898fd66ce2.mp4?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore, fight, and loot your way through randomly-generated dungeons in the game's Endless Dungeon mode where your sole goal is to survive to reach Level 20. Discover a variety of “mini-quests” to keep things interesting as you descend the depths.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/5f31c981b99410eb81e01edbf0cb06b3.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d140c9a326b2f3f1d5468fbc1b4b5c9e.poster.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d140c9a326b2f3f1d5468fbc1b4b5c9e.webm?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Firstborn were immortal beings created to help shepherd and guide the universe. After violating the gods' prohibition on creating new life, they were sealed away and became a mere myth. Lead your party to uncover the truth of what really happened and decide if the Firstborn poses too great of a threat on the world, or if they are your path to immense power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/c64b034cbea2e1f263e8f7e9563066fd.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d7f62bbdace6a87eee6d55665fa14fa0.poster.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d7f62bbdace6a87eee6d55665fa14fa0.webm?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/d7f62bbdace6a87eee6d55665fa14fa0.mp4?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Engage in exciting turn-based combat using one of the most accurate implementations of the classic 3.5 SRD. Equip and ride a war-horse, mastering mounted combat, a rarely-seen feature in overhead RPGs. Employ over 300 spells to vanquish your enemies of over 120 classic monsters who respond with intelligent, reactive AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/dbe885537bd6d1b55363f6ec72e15e66.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/4e9be0eeda229592aff65e7a8bb0e162.poster.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/4e9be0eeda229592aff65e7a8bb0e162.webm?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/4e9be0eeda229592aff65e7a8bb0e162.mp4?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Wander the countryside in search of long-forgotten treasures, but beware, many of them are well-guarded. Be careful not to stray off the beaten path too soon, as you might discover encounters more difficult than what you bargained for...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/156cbf2fb62c68b0d6b16329cb50992c.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/f095fe7411194b0381b48a898fd66ce2.poster.avif?t=1788119739\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/f095fe7411194b0381b48a898fd66ce2.webm?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429270/extras/f095fe7411194b0381b48a898fd66ce2.mp4?t=1788119739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore, fight, and loot your way through randomly-generated dungeons in the game's Endless Dungeon mode where your sole goal is to survive to reach Level 20. Discover a variety of “mini-quests” to keep things interesting as you descend the depths.</p>", "short_description": "Lead a party of heroes in this story-rich, tactical turn-based RPG based on the classic 3.5 SRD ruleset. Uncover the origin of the Firstborn and decide if their power will bring the world its salvation, or annihilation.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app